<!-- [XPLAT] migrated from net48/WinForms — see MIGRATION_DOCS/TRANSITION_MAP.md -->
<!--
    [XPLAT] Avalonia 1:1 PARITY reimplementation of the WinForms `Forms/FormSaving`
    (source: FormSaving.cs + FormSaving.Designer.cs) — the modal "saving in progress"
    dialog shown while a field/settings save sequence runs. This is a faithful
    re-platform, never a redesign: every size, font and colour below is taken verbatim
    from FormSaving.Designer.cs and the behaviour is preserved exactly (AAP §0.3.3).

    Shell parity (FormSaving / FormSaving.Designer.cs):
      * Form.Text "FormSaving"; ClientSize 933x491; FormBorderStyle=None -> SystemDecorations="None";
        ControlBox=false; TopMost=true; ShowInTaskbar=false. The WinForms StartPosition was
        CenterScreen; this dialog is shown owned/modal during the save, so CenterOwner is used
        (AAP wiring) for the same centred-on-screen result.
      * Form.BackColor = Color.FromArgb(0,192,0) = #00C000 (green). panel1 sits at (12,12) sized
        909x467 with BackColor = Color.FromArgb(255,192,128) = #FFC080 (peach); the 12px green
        margin framing the peach panel is reproduced by Window Background="#00C000" plus a
        Border with Margin="12". These colours are hard-coded for parity — FormSaving is
        theme-independent, so the App.axaml day/night brushes are intentionally NOT used here.

    Contents (panel1 children) — preserved 1:1:
      * listViewSteps : the WinForms ListView (View=List, BorderStyle=None, BackColor #FFC080,
        Microsoft Sans Serif 24pt Bold, at (67,22) sized 771x333) becomes an ItemsControl. Each
        saving step is one item. The glyph/colour rules live in the behaviour (FormSaving.cs
        GetStepText/GetStepColor): "• " Pending, "✓ " Done, "✗ " Failed; ForeColor Gray when
        Pending, otherwise Black.
      * progressBar : the WinForms Marquee ProgressBar at (182,374) sized 566x28 -> an Avalonia
        ProgressBar with IsIndeterminate="True" (the equivalent continuously-running animation).
      * labelBeer   : the WinForms Label (Microsoft Sans Serif 24pt Bold, ForeColor Green,
        hidden until Finish()) -> a TextBlock, IsVisible="False" until Finish().

    Code-behind contract — FormSavingView.axaml.cs (partial class AgOpenGPS.Views.FormSavingView : Window):
      * Declares a parameterless constructor that calls InitializeComponent().
      * Owns the three named controls referenced below: listViewSteps, progressBar, labelBeer.
      * Assigns listViewSteps.ItemsSource = an ObservableCollection of step view items, where each
        item exposes EXACTLY these two public properties (reflection bindings — there is no
        x:DataType / compiled binding here, so the property NAMES are the contract):
            string Text       -> bound to the row TextBlock.Text       (glyph + message)
            IBrush Foreground -> bound to the row TextBlock.Foreground  (Gray for Pending, else Black)
      * AddStep(key,message) / UpdateStep(key,message,state) mutate that collection (parity with
        the WinForms ListViewItem add/update by key).
      * Finish() sets progressBar.IsVisible=false and labelBeer.IsVisible=true and assigns
        labelBeer.Text = "✔ " + gStr.gsSaveBeerTime (the localized "beer time" string).

    No WinForms, no OpenTK, no Win32 types are referenced — Avalonia 11.3 markup only.
-->
<Window xmlns="https://github.com/avaloniaui"
        xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
        x:Class="AgOpenGPS.Views.FormSavingView"
        Title="FormSaving"
        Width="933" Height="491"
        Background="{DynamicResource AogSavingGreenBrush}"
        CanResize="False"
        SystemDecorations="None"
        Topmost="True"
        ShowInTaskbar="False"
        WindowStartupLocation="CenterOwner"
        FontFamily="Microsoft Sans Serif">

    <!-- panel1: the peach inner panel. Margin="12" reveals the green Window background as the
         12px frame, matching panel1 Location (12,12) / Size 909x467 over the 933x491 form. -->
    <Border Margin="12" Background="#FFC080">

        <!-- Vertical layout. The steps list fills the top; the progress bar and the beer label
             share the bottom band and swap visibility, exactly as FormSaving.Finish() does. -->
        <Grid RowDefinitions="*,Auto">

            <!-- listViewSteps — WinForms ListView at (67,22) 771x333. Margin "67,22,71,0" over the
                 909-wide / 467-tall panel reproduces that rectangle exactly (909-67-71 = 771 wide;
                 the bottom band below consumes 112px, leaving 355 - top 22 = 333 tall). Background
                 is left transparent so the peach Border shows through (the ListView BackColor
                 matched the panel). -->
            <ItemsControl x:Name="listViewSteps"
                          Grid.Row="0"
                          Margin="67,22,71,0">
                <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                    <DataTemplate>
                        <!-- Microsoft Sans Serif 24pt Bold == 32px at 96dpi (24 * 96/72). Text and
                             Foreground are supplied per item by the code-behind (contract above). -->
                        <TextBlock Text="{Binding Text}"
                                   Foreground="{Binding Foreground}"
                                   FontFamily="Microsoft Sans Serif"
                                   FontSize="32"
                                   FontWeight="Bold"
                                   TextWrapping="NoWrap" />
                    </DataTemplate>
                </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
            </ItemsControl>

            <!-- Bottom band. Margin "0,12,0,63" places the band so labelBeer's top lands at y=367
                 (467 - 63 - 37) — exactly the WinForms labelBeer Location.Y — with the progress bar
                 vertically centred in the same band (~y=371, matching progressBar Location.Y 374). -->
            <Grid Grid.Row="1" Margin="0,12,0,63">

                <!-- progressBar — WinForms Marquee ProgressBar at (182,374) 566x28. Centred
                     horizontally (566 of 909). IsIndeterminate reproduces the running marquee. -->
                <ProgressBar x:Name="progressBar"
                             Width="566"
                             Height="28"
                             HorizontalAlignment="Center"
                             VerticalAlignment="Center"
                             IsIndeterminate="True" />

                <!-- labelBeer — WinForms Label, ForeColor=Color.Green (#008000), 24pt Bold, hidden
                     until Finish(). Design-time default text mirrors the WinForms designer default;
                     the code-behind overrides it at runtime with "✔ " + gStr.gsSaveBeerTime. -->
                <TextBlock x:Name="labelBeer"
                           IsVisible="False"
                           Text="✔ See you next time!"
                           Foreground="Green"
                           FontFamily="Microsoft Sans Serif"
                           FontSize="32"
                           FontWeight="Bold"
                           HorizontalAlignment="Center"
                           VerticalAlignment="Center" />
            </Grid>
        </Grid>
    </Border>
</Window>
